[Event "Trap: Elephant Gambit, refuted"]
[Punisher "White"]
[Result "*"]

1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 d5 {3...Qxd5 4.Nc3! gains the same tempo as against the Scandinavian} 3. exd5 e4 4. Qe2 {hits the stray pawn; 4...Nf6 5.d3 keeps it too} 4... Qxd5 5. Nc3 {double attack on queen and pawn} 5... Qe6 6. Nxe4 {a clean pawn up — 6...Qxe4?? 7.Qxe4+ wins the queen on the pinned file} *

[Event "Trap: Caro-Kann smothered mate"]
[Punisher "White"]
[Result "1-0"]

1. e4 c6 2. d4 d5 3. Nc3 dxe4 4. Nxe4 Nd7 {our repertoire's 4...Bf5 sidesteps this entirely} 5. Qe2 Ngf6 {the losing move — 5...Ndf6 or 5...e6 and Black is fine} 6. Nd6# {exd6 is illegal: the e7 pawn is pinned by Qe2} 1-0
